{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slot Racing: a hypnotic dance between you and the rail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivalsCoverDescription.jpg?t=1745147634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>slot</strong> racing game where precision and strategy make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 Compete on frenetic tracks inspired by the golden age of <strong>Slot Racing</strong>, upgrade your vehicles and climb the ranks in tournaments to become the best driver. \ud83c\udfc6 With an immersive <strong>story mode \ud83d\udcd6</strong>, a <strong>competitive multiplayer \ud83d\udee3\ufe0f</strong>, and a <strong>zen </strong>mode<strong> \ud83d\ude34</strong> in case you need to relax <strong>\ud83d\ude34</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn is a challenge and every win a step closer to the top - do you have what it takes to dominate the track? \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_SteamCapture_2.jpg?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfc1Fast-paced and strategic competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed races where\u00a0<strong>precision is everything</strong>. Master acceleration, braking, and counterbalance to avoid derailing on sharp turns and stay in the fight for victory. Each track is designed to challenge your skills, offering an intense and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_1.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfce\ufe0fWide selection of cars and advanced customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over\u00a0<strong>50 unique vehicles</strong>, ranging from entry-level models to elite racing machines. Upgrade key components like the engine, tires, transmission, and turbo to optimize performance and adapt to different tracks and driving styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_2.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Legendary tracks and track editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race on circuits inspired by\u00a0<strong>iconic slot car tracks</strong>, featuring technical turns, high-speed straights, and challenging sections. Plus, the\u00a0<strong>track editor</strong>\u00a0lets you design and share your own custom tracks, fine-tuning every detail to create unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_3.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 Story mode with progression and tournaments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the journey of a rookie driver striving to\u00a0<strong>make a name</strong>\u00a0in the slot racing world. Compete in\u00a0<strong>tournaments</strong>, earn reputation, unlock new cars, and prove you have what it takes to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_4.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd8 Zen mode for practice and exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A\u00a0<strong>stress-free mode</strong>\u00a0where you can drive freely, with no time limits or rivals. Perfect for honing your skills, testing upgrades, and\u00a0<strong>exploring</strong>\u00a0track details at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_5.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389390?t=1745147634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/e47ac6d7a5e383810b3d3df58143c8d99e85360b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745147634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/9450705ec55ce225eac68aa8d734dd0c194fb1a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745147634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/9450705ec55ce225eac68aa8d734dd0c194fb1a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745147634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slot Racing: a hypnotic dance between you and the rail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivalsCoverDescription.jpg?t=1745147634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>slot</strong> racing game where precision and strategy make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 Compete on frenetic tracks inspired by the golden age of <strong>Slot Racing</strong>, upgrade your vehicles and climb the ranks in tournaments to become the best driver. \ud83c\udfc6 With an immersive <strong>story mode \ud83d\udcd6</strong>, a <strong>competitive multiplayer \ud83d\udee3\ufe0f</strong>, and a <strong>zen </strong>mode<strong> \ud83d\ude34</strong> in case you need to relax <strong>\ud83d\ude34</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn is a challenge and every win a step closer to the top - do you have what it takes to dominate the track? \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_SteamCapture_2.jpg?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfc1Fast-paced and strategic competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed races where\u00a0<strong>precision is everything</strong>. Master acceleration, braking, and counterbalance to avoid derailing on sharp turns and stay in the fight for victory. Each track is designed to challenge your skills, offering an intense and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_1.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfce\ufe0fWide selection of cars and advanced customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over\u00a0<strong>50 unique vehicles</strong>, ranging from entry-level models to elite racing machines. Upgrade key components like the engine, tires, transmission, and turbo to optimize performance and adapt to different tracks and driving styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_2.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Legendary tracks and track editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race on circuits inspired by\u00a0<strong>iconic slot car tracks</strong>, featuring technical turns, high-speed straights, and challenging sections. Plus, the\u00a0<strong>track editor</strong>\u00a0lets you design and share your own custom tracks, fine-tuning every detail to create unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_3.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 Story mode with progression and tournaments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the journey of a rookie driver striving to\u00a0<strong>make a name</strong>\u00a0in the slot racing world. Compete in\u00a0<strong>tournaments</strong>, earn reputation, unlock new cars, and prove you have what it takes to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_4.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd8 Zen mode for practice and exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A\u00a0<strong>stress-free mode</strong>\u00a0where you can drive freely, with no time limits or rivals. Perfect for honing your skills, testing upgrades, and\u00a0<strong>exploring</strong>\u00a0track details at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/SpeedRivals_Caracteristic_5.gif?t=1745147634\" /></p>","developers":["BabelGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descr